# Frontend

- UI renders **validated** canonical intelligence; do not invent facts client-side.
- Customer vs Pro is **authorization/presentation**, not a separate truth or automatic re-analysis.
- Use shared contracts from `engine/shared` / `brain/contracts/` for API shapes.
- Interactive representations (map, timeline, provenance drill-down) consume persisted intelligence — not ad-hoc model calls on navigation.

See `brain/product/v2-experience.md`, `brain/architecture/frontend-backend-contract.md`.
